{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>חלום</b> in gematria is this: בנבואה." "<b>סולם</b> in gematria is this: כסא הכבוד." "<b>סולם</b> in gematria equals קול. Equivalent is the prayer of the righteous — it is a ladder for angels to ascend upon. So too the angel ascended in the flame of the offering, and prayer is the avodah. Therefore whoever has proper intent in his prayer, the ladder is complete in its rungs and they can ascend upon it. <b>סולם</b>: in gematria ממון and in gematria עוני, for this humbles and that lifts up." "<b>סלם</b> — letters of סמל — for He showed him how his sons are the attendants of idolatry." "<b>והנה סלם</b> in gematria is וקץ — for He showed him the ends of the exiles." "<b>סלם</b> in gematria is סיני — for He showed him the standing at Mount Sinai." "<b>סלם מוצב</b> in gematria is מרכבו." "<b>מוצב</b> — three times in the Masorah: here, and the other: אלון מוצב אשר בשכם, and: וצרתי עליך מוצב. He showed him the entry into the land — this is מוצב אשר בשכם, for that place they conquered first. And the exile from it — this is וצרתי עליך מוצב." "<b>סלם</b> — letters of למס. For He hinted to him the exiles, and He hinted to him the offerings." "<b>והנה סולם מוצב</b> in gematria is הכבש." "<b>ארצה</b> — hint to מזבח אדמה." "<b>וראשו מגיע השמימה</b> — hint to the fragrance of the offerings that ascends heavenward. Another interpretation: <b>והנה סלם</b> in gematria is וזה מזבח העולה." "<b>והנה מלאכי</b> — letters of אלו הכהנים. Who ascend and descend on the ramp." "<b>מוצב ארצה וראשו מגיע השמימה</b> — hint to one who is cast to the earth for a time — he will ascend heavenward." "<b>מלאכי אלהים</b> — two occurrences juxtaposed: here, and the other: ויפגעו בו מלאכי אלהים. Thus they said in the Midrash: angels who accompanied him in the land did not accompany him outside the land — this is מלאכי אלהים עולים, those that accompanied him in the land. ויפגעו בו מלאכי אלהים — these are the angels of Elohim that ascended then and encountered him now to accompany him in the land." "<b>עלים [ויורדים]</b> in gematria is בבל מדי יון ורומי."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {15 "The bracketed [ויורדים] appears to be a textual supplement; translated as presented."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:25.938707165Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}